<TextPage title="About Uncensored Index" description="An independent testing publication for uncensored, roleplay, and privacy-focused AI systems.">
  <h2>The job</h2><p>Uncensored Index exists to replace recycled affiliate claims with dated tests. The site separates model behavior, provider behavior, and hosted-product behavior because they are not the same thing.</p>
  <h2>What we publish</h2><p>We publish model profiles, controlled comparisons, research datasets, privacy and price changes, and eventually product reviews. Public evidence is non-explicit.</p>
  <h2>What we do not operate</h2><p>We do not host an adult chatbot, generator, public gallery, comment system, or user-upload service.</p>
</TextPage>
